4. FILES
============================================================

config.h
    Hardware configuration constants.

bitops.h
    Bitwise address decomposition and address construction.

tlb.h / tlb.c
    32-entry PID-tagged TLB.

page_table.h / page_table.c
    Page-table allocation, lookup, mapping and unmapping.

process.h / process.c
    Process state, page table, resident-page count and page limits.

physical_memory.h / physical_memory.c
    Physical-frame metadata and global-LRU support.

l1_lru.h / l1_lru.c
    L1 4x4 square-matrix LRU logic.

l1.h / l1.c
    L1 lookup, fill, way prediction and replacement.

l2_lru.h / l2_lru.c
    L2 LRU-counter metadata.

l2.h / l2.c
    L2 lookup, fill, dirty-bit handling and writeback.

memory_system.h / memory_system.c
    Connects all subsystem components and executes the complete memory
    reference path. Also provides statistics and state dumps.

main.c
    Deterministic demonstration driver.

comprehensive_test.c
    Comprehensive deterministic test program.

Makefile
    Builds simulator and comprehensive-test executables.

memory_test_report.txt
    Formatted output produced by the comprehensive test.

README.txt
    This file.


